## Step 3, the despeckle tool and the print gate

- The despeckle tool ran on each of the 2 new line tries:
  `node scripts/storytime-muse.mjs despeckle <spec> --from 1 --try 4`. The tool refused to write,
  because the line call had already written the despeckled pair and the tool never overwrites a
  file. Both files of every row exist: `-line-4-despeckled.png` and `-line-print-4-despeckled.png`.
- The print gate ran on the 2 new line prints and on their 2 despeckled prints. It calls the writer
  check code `inspectLineArtPng` of src/storytime/book-pictures.ts at the class size of the row.
  The record is measure/runs/asset_storytime_l2_retries_cover_20261110/line-gate-p2d.txt.

